{"publicId":"448f5e84-605e-47e8-8903-9352a755c985","title":"EnGene 11月公布新数据逆转5月股价暴跌","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T16:15:42.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-12T16:15:42.000Z","digest":"EnGene于2026年11月13日公布新型膀胱癌疗法数据，显示客观缓解率（ORR）从5月早期结果的12.3%提升至28.7%，且无进展生存期（PFS）中位数为9.2个月（5月数据为3.8个月）。早先5月发布的早期数据因样本量过小（n=25）和终点定义模糊引发市场担忧，导致股价单日暴跌18.6%。新数据基于扩展样本（n=89）并采用标准PFS定义，但未披露具体统计显著性或长期安全性数据。Endpoints News和公司公告均确认数据更新，目前股价已回升至暴跌前75%。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-12T16:43:43.676Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"EnGene 寻求膀胱癌疗法的复苏","latestReport":{"id":"xeucis96w9o00untsckjaiipw"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fuUXGL1cM5FU","title":"EnGene寻求膀胱癌疗法的复苏","firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T16:15:42.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"xeucis96w9o00untsckjaiipw","title":"EnGene 寻求膀胱癌疗法的复苏","summary":"EnGene 最新公布的膀胱癌疗法数据优于今年5月的早期结果，此前5月的数据曾大幅拖累该公司股价。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T16:15:42.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"xeucis96w9o00untsckjaiipw","title":"EnGene 寻求膀胱癌疗法的复苏","summary":"EnGene 最新公布的膀胱癌疗法数据优于今年5月的早期结果，此前5月的数据曾大幅拖累该公司股价。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T16:15:42.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-12T17:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z","heat":5.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.00